      "timeline_data": "{\"version\":1,\"items\":[{\"id\":\"image-1786042095394-0\",\"enabled\":true,\"order\":0,\"slot\":0,\"start\":0,\"duration\":1,\"type\":\"image\",\"value\":\"1.webp\",\"prompt\":\"Second 1: Awakening\\n\\\"From frozen stillness, the elf warrior begins to breathe naturally—chest rising and falling gently. The white fur collar rustles slightly. Wind catches her pink hair, starting a slow, graceful sway behind her. She remains in pose but now feels alive.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 2: Alert Gaze Shift\\n\\\"Hearing something distant, she shifts her eyes from center toward the side with an alert expression. Her pointed ears twitch subtly. The movement is quick and instinctive—warrior instincts kicking in as she assesses a sound.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 3: Reaching for Arrows\\n\\\"Her right hand slides from the bow grip to brush against the feathered tips of arrows in her quiver—a preparatory motion. Her fingers graze them thoughtfully before returning to re-grip the bow more firmly, showing readiness.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 4: Confident Smile Forms\\n\\\"She returns her gaze forward as a knowing half-smile slowly forms on her lips—confidence replacing alertness. Her blue gem necklace catches light as it shifts with her movement. The smile suggests she's found what she was looking for or has made her decision.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 5: Settled Poise\\n\\\"All motion settles into natural, subtle animation—gentle breathing continues, hair still drifts softly in the wind. She holds her bow confidently, fully alive and present in this moment of calm readiness.\\\"\"}],\"prompt_blocks\":[{\"id\":\"attached-image-1786042095394-0\",\"text\":\"Second 1: Awakening\\n\\\"From frozen stillness, the elf warrior begins to breathe naturally—chest rising and falling gently. The white fur collar rustles slightly. Wind catches her pink hair, starting a slow, graceful sway behind her. She remains in pose but now feels alive.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 2: Alert Gaze Shift\\n\\\"Hearing something distant, she shifts her eyes from center toward the side with an alert expression. Her pointed ears twitch subtly. The movement is quick and instinctive—warrior instincts kicking in as she assesses a sound.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 3: Reaching for Arrows\\n\\\"Her right hand slides from the bow grip to brush against the feathered tips of arrows in her quiver—a preparatory motion. Her fingers graze them thoughtfully before returning to re-grip the bow more firmly, showing readiness.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 4: Confident Smile Forms\\n\\\"She returns her gaze forward as a knowing half-smile slowly forms on her lips—confidence replacing alertness. Her blue gem necklace catches light as it shifts with her movement. The smile suggests she's found what she was looking for or has made her decision.\\\"\\n\\nSecond 5: Settled Poise\\n\\\"All motion settles into natural, subtle animation—gentle breathing continues, hair still drifts softly in the wind. She holds her bow confidently, fully alive and present in this moment of calm readiness.\\\"\",\"enabled\":true,\"start\":0,\"duration\":1,\"order\":0}]}",
